{"query_id": "dp-long-hall-transcript", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "Councillor Reallhollow made the following commitments at the village hall trustees' open meeting:\n\n1. \"I'm putting £6,497.92 from my ward budget towards the new kitchen, and that is settled.\" [2]\n2. \"I will have the roof survey back to the trustees by 2026-01-15, you have my word on that.\" [3]\n3. \"Youth groups will keep paying 66.6 per cent of the standard hire rate for as long as I'm on this committee.\" [4]\n4. \"I'll give 58 hours a month to the repair cafe until we find a regular volunteer.\" [5]\n5. \"The ramp at the side door will be finished before 2026-03-18; I'll chase the builder myself.\" [6]\n6. \"While the library is shut I'll keep the hall open late on Thursdays, for the next 82 calendar days at least.\" [7]", "answer_sha256": "a5ab212d025f173925de210216f568c8201530070a49a91098ababcd0242eea8", "ranked_ids": ["hall-transcript-long"], "citation_map": {"1": "hall-transcript-long", "10": "hall-transcript-long", "11": "hall-transcript-long", "12": "hall-transcript-long", "13": "hall-transcript-long", "14": "hall-transcript-long", "15": "hall-transcript-long", "16": "hall-transcript-long", "17": "hall-transcript-long", "2": "hall-transcript-long", "3": "hall-transcript-long", "4": "hall-transcript-long", "5": "hall-transcript-long", "6": "hall-transcript-long", "7": "hall-transcript-long", "8": "hall-transcript-long", "9": "hall-transcript-long"}, "cited_ids": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "cited_document_ids": ["hall-transcript-long"], "invalid_citations": [], "abstained": false, "expected_abstain": false, "mechanical_checks_passed": true, "answer_correct": null, "review_status": "unreviewed", "latency_ms": 201150, "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M.gguf", "error": null, "turn_scores": [{"turn": 0, "mechanical": {"missing_facts": [], "forbidden_claims": [], "cited_ids": [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7], "invalid_citations": [], "cited_document_ids": ["hall-transcript-lo