{"query_id": "dp-long-choir-minutes", "tags": ["long-document"], "dimensions": ["long-document"], "answer": "The choir committee minutes record the following about the Holdmere fund:\n\n*   The treasurer noted that the reserve is healthy but should not be run down [9], [10], [11], [18], [19], [21], [23], [24], [25], [27], [30].\n*   Applications to the Holdmere fund must be lodged 55 calendar days before the concert they are meant to support [3].\n*   The Holdmere fund received a further £6,133.78 from the retiring collection at the summer concert [7].\n*   Agreed to release £5,618.82 from the Holdmere fund towards new music stands [4].\n*   Resolved that no more than 65.5 per cent of the Holdmere fund may be spent in any one season [6].\n*   The treasurer closed the old bank account of the Holdmere fund on 2029-09-22 and moved the balance to the building society [2].\n*   The trustees of the Holdmere fund will next report to the committee on 2027-06-19 [5].", "answer_sha256": "92d36c71bb9f2c3322029e6b2f4fb9e52dee4719e9ccf8792866d44d80e59afa", "ranked_ids": ["choir-minutes-long", "repeated-coach-thread"], "citation_map": {"1": "choir-minutes-long", "10": "choir-minutes-long", "11": "choir-minutes-long", "12": "choir-minutes-long", "13": "choir-minutes-long", "14": "choir-minutes-long", "15": "choir-minutes-long", "16": "choir-minutes-long", "17": "choir-minutes-long", "18": "choir-minutes-long", "19": "choir-minutes-long", "2": "choir-minutes-long", "20": "choir-minutes-long", "21": "choir-minutes-long", "22": "choir-minutes-long", "23": "choir-minutes-long", "24": "choir-minutes-long", "25": "choir-minutes-long", "26": "repeated-coach-thread", "27": "choir-minutes-long", "28": "choir-minutes-long", "29": "repeated-coach-thread", "3": "choir-minutes-long", "30": "choir-minutes-long", "4": "choir-minutes-long", "5": "choir-minutes-long", "6": "choir-minutes-long", "7": "choir-minutes-long", "8": "choir-minutes-long", "9": "choir-minutes-long"}, "cited_ids": [9, 10, 1